  },
  {
    "layout": "TASK1-GROUND-OVERVIEW",
    "handle": "7BBA",
    "type": "AcDbMText",
    "layer": "E-T1-PAPER-NOTES",
    "TextString": "PROPOSED LOCATION\\PLower-left perimeter of supplied ground-floor plan. Substation 12430 x 5450; adjacent LV room 12430 x 3500 assumed. See separate 1:75 room detail.",
    "InsertionPoint": [
      305.0,
      260.0,
      0.0
    ],
    "Width": 102.0,
    "Height": 2.8
  },
  {
    "layout": "TASK1-GROUND-OVERVIEW",
    "handle": "7BBB",
    "type": "AcDbMText",
    "layer": "E-T1-PAPER-NOTES",
    "TextString": "LOCATION REASONS\\PDirect external plant access can be reserved subject to site confirmation.\\PAdjacent LV room keeps transformer-to-incomer interfaces short.\\PPerimeter plantrooms separate supply equipment from the upper lift/stair/AHU core and remaining accommodation.\\PLV room has its own proposed west entrance.",
    "InsertionPoint": [
      305.0,
      212.0,
      0.0
    ],
    "Width": 102.0,
    "Height": 2.8
  },
  {
    "layout": "TASK1-GROUND-OVERVIEW",
    "handle": "7BBC",
    "type": "AcDbMText",
    "layer": "E-T1-PAPER-NOTES",
    "TextString": "LOAD ASSESSMENT\\POffices: 1644.800 kVA.\\PAC: 1000 kW cooling -> 526.039 kW electrical -> 584.488 kVA at assumed PF 0.90.\\PPublic services: 200 kVA aggregate allowance.\\PTwo-zone conservative envelope: 2672.216 kVA.\\PPropose 2 x 1500 kVA, with equal zone allocation; no full-load N-1.",
    "InsertionPoint": [
      305.0,
      143.0,
      0.0
    ],
    "Width": 102.0,
    "Height": 2.8
  },
  {
    "layout": "TASK1-GROUND-OVERVIEW",
    "handle": "7BBD",
    "type": "AcDbMText",
    "layer": "E-T1-PAPER-NOTES",
    "TextString": "SITE CONDITIONS TO VERIFY\\PExternal apron, road and <=20m unloading route are not given by the source plan. Maintain >=3m clear delivery route.\\PArchitectural wall openings, structural/flood/fire provisions, ventilation and supplier equipment approval require coordination.",
    "InsertionPoint": [
      305.0,
      68.0,
      0.0
    ],
    "Width": 102.0,
    "Height": 2.8
  },
  {
