  },
  {
    "layout": "TASK1-ROOM-REVIEW",
    "handle": "8029",
    "type": "AcDbMText",
    "layer": "E-T1-PAPER-NOTES",
    "TextString": "CAPACITY AND EQUIPMENT\\P2 x 1500 kVA proposed; normal load envelope 2672.216 kVA. No full-load N-1.\\PHV: 3000 x 1000 reservation.\\PTX-A/B: 2200 x 1800 each.\\PThese are assumed equipment envelopes, not manufacturer footprints.",
    "InsertionPoint": [
      270.0,
      262.0,
      0.0
    ],
    "Width": 140.0,
    "Height": 2.7
  },
  {
    "layout": "TASK1-ROOM-REVIEW",
    "handle": "802A",
    "type": "AcDbMText",
    "layer": "E-T1-PAPER-NOTES",
    "TextString": "CLEARANCES / BUILDING WORKS\\PHV rear 1000, front 1800, sides 750. TX LV terminals north: 900; other sides 750.\\PProposed 2h FRR partitions; fire-seal penetrations. FFL +0.15 vs external +0.00 assumed.\\PActual structures, wall thickness and equipment dimensions require coordination.",
    "InsertionPoint": [
      270.0,
      210.0,
      0.0
    ],
    "Width": 140.0,
    "Height": 2.7
  },
  {
    "layout": "TASK1-ROOM-REVIEW",
    "handle": "802B",
    "type": "AcDbMText",
    "layer": "E-T1-PAPER-NOTES",
    "TextString": "ACCESS AND DOORS\\PSouth external access assumed. Reserve 3000-wide delivery route; unloading distance <=20m to verify.\\PPlant doors: HV 4000 W; TX 3000 W each; 2800H assumed. 180-degree outward sweep, shown open 90 degrees.\\PShared sweeps: use adjacent doors sequentially. TX-A designated wicket personnel access. Independent LV entrance west.",
    "InsertionPoint": [
      270.0,
      153.0,
      0.0
    ],
    "Width": 140.0,
    "Height": 2.7
  },
  {
    "layout": "TASK1-ROOM-REVIEW",
    "handle": "802C",
    "type": "AcDbMText",
    "layer": "E-T1-PAPER-NOTES",
    "TextString": "VENTILATION\\P2 low-level 600 W x 2000H inlet louvres: 2.4m2 gross x assumed 50% free area = 1.20m2 >=1.12m2. Certified free area >=46.67% required.\\P2 high-level 630-dia fan symbols are conditional references. Actual losses, fan duty and noise to confirm; outlet >=2.5m above street, away from people.",
    "InsertionPoint": [
      270.0,
      85.0,
      0.0
    ],
    "Width": 140.0,
    "Height": 2.7
  },
  {
    "layout": "TASK1-ROOM-REVIEW",
    "handle": "802D",
    "type": "AcDbMText",
    "layer": "E-T1-PAPER-NOTES",
    "TextString": "LV INTERFACES / HV ROUTES\\PLV trench: 1000 W x 1100D, four MCTs per interface. A: 8.03+2=10.03m; B: 8.31+2=10.31m (<20m). 2m is assumed total termination/vertical allowance.\\PHV centre-lines: 1000 W at panels; 600 W branches; final 300 W; generally 1400D. Segregate HV/LV. Covered trenches; no beam obstruction.",
    "InsertionPoint": [
      12.0,
      60.0,
      0.0
    ],
    "Width": 245.0,
    "Height": 2.7
  },
  {
    "layout": "TASK1-ROOM-REVIEW",
    "handle": "802E",
    "type": "AcDbMText",
    "layer": "E-T1-PAPER-NOTES",
    "TextString": "DETAIL 1:75 AT A3",
    "InsertionPoint": [
      12.0,
      18.0,
      0.0
    ],
    "Width": 245.0,
    "Height": 2.7
  },
  {
    "layout": "TASK1-ROOM-REVIEW",
