    "type": "AcDbMText",
    "layer": "E-T1-PAPER-NOTES",
    "TextString": "Basis: supplied COP215 Rev07; COP101 v16 clauses 4.3, 5.5, 5.6, 6.1-6.7.\\PSee Task1 for load estimate, equipment reservations and design assumptions.",
